tgies/klattsch @ 63dc2c6 (MIT), vendored with patches:
  src/engine/sequencer.js: [TR=ms] sets the formant transition into steady phonemes (default 35 ms, at most 40% of the phoneme; with TR, up to 90%)
  src/engine/sequencer.js: [AV=x] scales loudness (the synth's gain, default 3.5) and glides with the phoneme's transition
  src/engine/sequencer.js: a stop's bank entry may set burstMs (default 25 ms for all)
  src/engine/dsp.js, src/engine/synth-core.js: [GS=1] an LF (Liljencrants-Fant) voice source instead of the Rosenberg pulse: lfShape(Rd) (Fant 1995), [RD=x] [RDE=oct/effort] shape and its effort coupling, [TL=dB at 3 kHz] one-pole tilt, [JIT=%] [SHIM=%] local jitter (closure-to-closure periods) and shimmer, [AM=0..1] noise scaled by the glottal flow while voiced, [FL=x] flutter (Klatt & Klatt 1990), [NT=dB] [AT=dB] one-pole low-pass of the frication / aspiration noise (Klatt's soft low-pass noise); without GS (or GS=0) every sample is as before
